  "question": "Are the 7 zero-candidate-edge missed multi-copy genes (LOC101141440, LOC115930538, LOC115934629, LOC129534585, TNK2, UBE2Q2P16, ZNF425) recoverable by LOOSENING the exact-18-mer candidate-generation pre-filter (shorter k / minimizers), and if so at what genome-wide candidate-blow-up / POA-compute / FP-precision cost?",
  "recoverable_by_loosening": 0,
  "verdict": "NOT WORTH IT. Loosening the exact-18-mer pre-filter recovers 0 of the 7 missed multi-copy genes (PRE-FILTER-BOTTLENECK is the ONLY loosening-recoverable class and it is empty). Scoring the ACTUAL validated_families member loci: 2/7 are DIVERGENCE-LIMIT (TNK2, UBE2Q2P16 -- 2-member families whose cleanest cross-copy RNA pair fails the POA gate, core_recip 0.05/0.02; genuinely DNA-bound), and 5/7 are REP-COLLAPSE/PROJECTION (the family HAS a POA-passing, 18-mer-proposed cross-copy member pair -- 2019/5311/3725/1401/1237 shared 18-mers, core_recip 0.85-1.0 -- so candidate-generation AND scoring already succeed; the gene's annotation region is lost DOWNSTREAM to intron-junction rep-collapse + gene_of max-overlap labelling, NOT to a candidate-generation-k gap). For LOC115930538 and ZNF425 the family is recovered from its OTHER near-identical copies while the gene's OWN transcript is a divergent/short-span paralog. NOTE: an earlier version mis-scored 3 of these as DIVERGENCE-LIMIT by re-deriving the per-copy rep as the max-n_reads locus over the copy's genomic SPAN (which on rep-collapsed loci is a non-member readthrough, or a locus in a DIFFERENT family) instead of the actual member; the real members score 0.93-1.0. Either way the recall gap is NOT candidate-generation-k-bound: every family edge is already proposed at k18. Loosening multiplies the candidate/POA load 3.3x at k13 (36.9x at k11, near-saturation) for 0 recovered genes. Precision is NOT the failure mode: POA filters the loosened candidates -- 0/300 k13-only pairs survive the gate (max core_recip 0.0706 << 0.13), so the FP over-merge set does NOT explode. Loosening is thus recall-SAFE but recall-USELESS: pure wasted compute."
